The module is implemented and the full self-test is running now. The slow portions are deliberate: 250,000 structure-aware guesses, exact enumeration on a capped small case, six attacks over eight fresh instances, and 100 composed relabelling checks.
diff --git a/results/2411.19413/gen_2411_19413.py b/results/2411.19413/gen_2411_19413.py
