I found and stopped a genuine generator bug before any gate report was written: the tiny enumeration case requested more rank than its marker construction could possibly span, causing rejection sampling to loop forever. I’m adding an explicit feasibility check and correcting that test case; this is exactly why the build/verify gates precede the oracle run.
